      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo Pickle Broom Buds.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake your Buds before they be yellow on the top, make a brine of Vinegar and Salt, which you must do onely by shaking it together till the Salt be melted, then put in your Buds, and keepe stirred once in a day till they be sunk within the Vinegar, be sure to keep close covered.\u003Cbr\u003E"
